        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    monthly_contribution = 500\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.06\n    months_per_year = 12\n    years = 10\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / months_per_year\n    number_of_periods = years * months_per_year\n    annuity_due = True\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    if monthly_interest_rate == 0:\n        future_value = monthly_contribution * number_of_periods\n    else:\n        future_value = (\n            monthly_contribution\n            * (((1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** number_of_periods - 1)\n               / monthly_interest_rate)\n        )\n\n        if annuity_due:\n            future_value *= 1 + monthly_interest_rate\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(future_value)\n```",
